  "aboutUs": "<h1>About&nbsp;Us</h1><p>At&nbsp;<strong>FindMyMusicGurukul</strong>,&nbsp;we&nbsp;believe&nbsp;that&nbsp;music&nbsp;is&nbsp;more&nbsp;than&nbsp;just&nbsp;a&nbsp;skill&nbsp;—&nbsp;it&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;passion,&nbsp;an&nbsp;expression,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;journey&nbsp;of&nbsp;lifelong&nbsp;learning.&nbsp;Our&nbsp;mission&nbsp;is&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;music&nbsp;education&nbsp;accessible&nbsp;to&nbsp;everyone&nbsp;by&nbsp;connecting&nbsp;aspiring&nbsp;learners&nbsp;with&nbsp;experienced&nbsp;music&nbsp;teachers&nbsp;who&nbsp;inspire,&nbsp;guide,&nbsp;and&nbsp;nurture&nbsp;their&nbsp;talent.</p><p></p><h2>Empowering&nbsp;Aspiring&nbsp;Musicians</h2><p>Our&nbsp;mission&nbsp;is&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;music&nbsp;education&nbsp;accessible&nbsp;to&nbsp;everyone&nbsp;by&nbsp;connecting&nbsp;aspiring&nbsp;learners&nbsp;with&nbsp;experienced&nbsp;music&nbsp;teachers&nbsp;who&nbsp;inspire,&nbsp;guide,&nbsp;and&nbsp;nurture&nbsp;their&nbsp;talent.&nbsp;Whether&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;a&nbsp;beginner&nbsp;taking&nbsp;your&nbsp;first&nbsp;steps&nbsp;or&nbsp;an&nbsp;experienced&nbsp;learner&nbsp;looking&nbsp;to&nbsp;refine&nbsp;your&nbsp;skills,&nbsp;we&nbsp;help&nbsp;you&nbsp;discover&nbsp;the&nbsp;right&nbsp;tutor&nbsp;to&nbsp;match&nbsp;your&nbsp;goals.</p><p></p><h3>Our&nbsp;Mission</h3><p>To&nbsp;simplify&nbsp;the&nbsp;process&nbsp;of&nbsp;finding&nbsp;the&nbsp;right&nbsp;music&nbsp;teacher&nbsp;and&nbsp;create&nbsp;opportunities&nbsp;for&nbsp;students&nbsp;and&nbsp;tutors&nbsp;to&nbsp;connect,&nbsp;learn,&nbsp;and&nbsp;grow&nbsp;together.&nbsp;We&nbsp;aim&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;quality&nbsp;music&nbsp;education&nbsp;more&nbsp;accessible&nbsp;through&nbsp;a&nbsp;convenient,&nbsp;reliable,&nbsp;and&nbsp;user-friendly&nbsp;platform.</p><p></p><h3>Our&nbsp;Vision</h3><p>We&nbsp;envision&nbsp;a&nbsp;world&nbsp;where&nbsp;anyone&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;passion&nbsp;for&nbsp;music&nbsp;can&nbsp;find&nbsp;the&nbsp;right&nbsp;guidance&nbsp;to&nbsp;develop&nbsp;their&nbsp;talent.&nbsp;By&nbsp;bringing&nbsp;students&nbsp;and&nbsp;educators&nbsp;together,&nbsp;we&nbsp;aspire&nbsp;to&nbsp;build&nbsp;a&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;community&nbsp;that&nbsp;celebrates&nbsp;creativity&nbsp;and&nbsp;musical&nbsp;excellence.</p><p></p><h3>What&nbsp;We&nbsp;Offer</h3><ul><li><strong>Find&nbsp;Music&nbsp;Tutors:</strong>&nbsp;Explore&nbsp;teachers&nbsp;based&nbsp;on&nbsp;your&nbsp;preferred&nbsp;instrument,&nbsp;music&nbsp;style,&nbsp;location,&nbsp;and&nbsp;unique&nbsp;learning&nbsp;requirements.</li><li><strong>Personalized&nbsp;Learning:</strong>&nbsp;Discover&nbsp;tutors&nbsp;who&nbsp;align&nbsp;perfectly&nbsp;with&nbsp;your&nbsp;current&nbsp;skill&nbsp;level,&nbsp;interests,&nbsp;and&nbsp;ambitious&nbsp;musical&nbsp;goals.</li><li><strong>Flexible&nbsp;Options:</strong>&nbsp;Find&nbsp;exciting&nbsp;opportunities&nbsp;for&nbsp;both&nbsp;online&nbsp;and&nbsp;offline&nbsp;music&nbsp;classes,&nbsp;seamlessly&nbsp;matching&nbsp;your&nbsp;schedule.</li><li><strong>Diverse&nbsp;Categories:</strong>&nbsp;Explore&nbsp;extensive&nbsp;vocal&nbsp;training,&nbsp;traditional&nbsp;classical&nbsp;music,&nbsp;diverse&nbsp;instrumental&nbsp;lessons,&nbsp;and&nbsp;other&nbsp;disciplines.</li><li><strong>Unprecedented&nbsp;Opportunities&nbsp;for&nbsp;Tutors:</strong>&nbsp;We&nbsp;don&#39;t&nbsp;just&nbsp;help&nbsp;students!&nbsp;We&nbsp;help&nbsp;music&nbsp;teachers&nbsp;elegantly&nbsp;showcase&nbsp;their&nbsp;expertise,&nbsp;connect&nbsp;directly&nbsp;with&nbsp;eager&nbsp;students,&nbsp;and&nbsp;exponentially&nbsp;expand&nbsp;their&nbsp;teaching&nbsp;reach&nbsp;across&nbsp;the&nbsp;country.</li></ul><p></p><h2>Why&nbsp;Choose&nbsp;FindMyMusicGurukul?</h2><p>We&nbsp;focus&nbsp;on&nbsp;making&nbsp;the&nbsp;music-learning&nbsp;experience&nbsp;simple,&nbsp;convenient,&nbsp;and&nbsp;highly&nbsp;accessible.&nbsp;Our&nbsp;platform&nbsp;is&nbsp;meticulously&nbsp;designed&nbsp;to&nbsp;help&nbsp;learners&nbsp;explore&nbsp;suitable&nbsp;tutors,&nbsp;make&nbsp;informed&nbsp;choices,&nbsp;and&nbsp;smoothly&nbsp;take&nbsp;the&nbsp;next&nbsp;step&nbsp;in&nbsp;their&nbsp;musical&nbsp;journey.</p><p></p><h3>Begin&nbsp;Your&nbsp;Musical&nbsp;Journey&nbsp;Today!</h3><p>Every&nbsp;great&nbsp;musician&nbsp;starts&nbsp;somewhere.&nbsp;Whether&nbsp;you&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn&nbsp;a&nbsp;new&nbsp;instrument,&nbsp;improve&nbsp;your&nbsp;singing,&nbsp;or&nbsp;share&nbsp;your&nbsp;musical&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;with&nbsp;others,&nbsp;we&nbsp;are&nbsp;here&nbsp;to&nbsp;help.</p><p><strong>&quot;Find&nbsp;your&nbsp;rhythm.&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;with&nbsp;passion.&nbsp;Grow&nbsp;with&nbsp;music.&quot;</strong></p>",
  "contactUs": "<h1>Contact&nbsp;Us</h1><p>We&#39;d&nbsp;love&nbsp;to&nbsp;hear&nbsp;from&nbsp;you!&nbsp;Whether&nbsp;you&nbsp;have&nbsp;a&nbsp;question&nbsp;about&nbsp;features,&nbsp;trials,&nbsp;pricing,&nbsp;need&nbsp;a&nbsp;demo,&nbsp;or&nbsp;anything&nbsp;else,&nbsp;our&nbsp;team&nbsp;is&nbsp;ready&nbsp;to&nbsp;answer&nbsp;all&nbsp;your&nbsp;questions.</p><p></p><h3>Contact&nbsp;Information</h3><p><strong>Phone:</strong>&nbsp;+91&nbsp;5684561844</p><p><strong>Email:</strong>&nbsp;support@findmyguru.com</p><p><strong>Support&nbsp;Hours:</strong>&nbsp;Monday&nbsp;-&nbsp;Saturday,&nbsp;9:00&nbsp;AM&nbsp;-&nbsp;9:00&nbsp;PM&nbsp;(IST)</p><p><strong>Address:</strong>&nbsp;Mumbai,&nbsp;Maharashtra,&nbsp;India</p>",
  "helpSupport": "<h1>Help&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Support</h1><p>Welcome&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;FindMyMusicGurukul&nbsp;Support&nbsp;Center.&nbsp;We&nbsp;are&nbsp;here&nbsp;to&nbsp;help&nbsp;you&nbsp;resolve&nbsp;any&nbsp;issues&nbsp;and&nbsp;answer&nbsp;your&nbsp;questions.</p><p></p><h3>How&nbsp;can&nbsp;we&nbsp;help?</h3><p>You&nbsp;can&nbsp;search&nbsp;our&nbsp;FAQs,&nbsp;read&nbsp;our&nbsp;detailed&nbsp;guides,&nbsp;or&nbsp;contact&nbsp;our&nbsp;support&nbsp;team&nbsp;directly.&nbsp;If&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;a&nbsp;student&nbsp;looking&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;tutor&nbsp;or&nbsp;a&nbsp;tutor&nbsp;trying&nbsp;to&nbsp;list&nbsp;your&nbsp;academy,&nbsp;we&nbsp;have&nbsp;dedicated&nbsp;resources&nbsp;for&nbsp;you.</p><ul><li><strong>For&nbsp;Students:</strong>&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;how&nbsp;to&nbsp;search,&nbsp;filter,&nbsp;and&nbsp;contact&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;music&nbsp;teachers&nbsp;in&nbsp;your&nbsp;area.</li><li><strong>For&nbsp;Tutors:</strong>&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;how&nbsp;to&nbsp;manage&nbsp;your&nbsp;profile,&nbsp;respond&nbsp;to&nbsp;inquiries,&nbsp;and&nbsp;upgrade&nbsp;your&nbsp;subscription&nbsp;plan.</li></ul>",
  "faqs": "<h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1><br/><h3>For Students</h3><p><strong>Q: What is FindMyGuru, and does it cost anything for me as a student?</strong><br/>A: FindMyGuru is a platform that connects students with music tutors. It is completely free for students to search and contact tutors.</p><p><strong>Q: How can I tell if a teacher is actually good?</strong><br/>A: You can check their ratings, read reviews from other students, and review their qualifications and demo videos on their profile.</p><p><strong>Q: What happens after I click \"Contact Teacher\"?</strong><br/>A: The teacher will receive your message and contact details, and they will reach out to you directly to discuss your requirements.</p><br/><h3>For Tutors</h3><p><strong>Q: How do I register as a tutor?</strong><br/>A: Simply click on the Register button and select 'Tutor' as your account type. Fill out your profile with accurate details.</p><p><strong>Q: How much does it cost to join?</strong><br/>A: We offer both free and premium subscription plans for tutors to list their profiles and get inquiries.</p>",
  "termsConditions": "<h1>Terms & Conditions</h1><h2>Introduction</h2><p>Welcome to FindMyMusicGurukul (“Platform,” “we,” “our,” or “us”). FindMyMusicGurukul is an online platform that connects music learners with music tutors and educators.</p><p>These Terms & Conditions govern your access to and use of our website, user accounts, tutor registration features, subscription plans, and related services.</p><p>By accessing the Platform, registering an account, using our services, or purchasing a subscription, you agree to these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree, please discontinue using the Platform.</p><h2>Eligibility and Account Registration</h2><p>You must provide accurate and complete information when creating an account. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials and for activities conducted through your account.</p><p>You agree to:</p><ul><li>Provide truthful registration and profile information.</li><li>Keep your contact details up to date.</li><li>Protect your password and account access.</li><li>Notify us if you suspect unauthorized access.</li><li>Use the Platform only for lawful purposes.</li></ul><p>Students who are minors must use the Platform with the involvement of a parent or legal guardian, as required by applicable law. Parents or guardians are responsible for appropriate supervision of minors' interactions with tutors.</p><h2>Services Provided</h2><p>FindMyMusicGurukul provides a platform to help users discover and connect with music tutors. Features may include:</p><ul><li>Music tutor search and discovery.</li><li>Tutor profiles, qualifications, experience, and specializations.</li><li>Student and tutor registration.</li><li>Enquiries and communication features.</li><li>Subscription plans for access to designated platform features.</li><li>Account management, notifications, and support.</li></ul><p>Features may change as the Platform develops. Availability of a particular feature is not guaranteed unless expressly stated.</p><h2>Tutor Responsibilities</h2><p>Tutors registering on FindMyMusicGurukul agree to:</p><ul><li>Provide accurate information about their identity, qualifications, experience, skills, and teaching services.</li><li>Upload only content they own or are authorized to use.</li><li>Communicate professionally and respectfully with students.</li><li>Clearly communicate class schedules, fees, availability, and lesson arrangements.</li><li>Respect student privacy and applicable child-safety requirements.</li><li>Comply with applicable laws and these Terms & Conditions.</li></ul><p>Tutors are responsible for the accuracy of their profiles, the services they offer, and the arrangements they make with students.</p><p>We may review, restrict, suspend, or remove profiles containing misleading information, prohibited content, or material that violates these terms.</p><h2>Student Responsibilities</h2><p>Students agree to:</p><ul><li>Provide accurate account information.</li><li>Communicate respectfully with tutors.</li><li>Review tutor profiles and suitability before arranging lessons.</li><li>Confirm class fees, schedules, lesson formats, and cancellation arrangements before committing.</li><li>Respect tutors' intellectual property and teaching materials.</li><li>Avoid harassment, fraud, impersonation, or misuse of another user's personal information.</li></ul><p>Where students are minors, parents or legal guardians should supervise communications and lesson arrangements as appropriate.</p><h2>Subscriptions and Payments</h2><p>FindMyMusicGurukul may offer free and paid subscription plans. Paid plans may provide access to additional features, visibility, or platform services, as described at the time of purchase.</p><p>Before purchasing a subscription, users should review the displayed price, billing frequency, included features, limitations, renewal terms, and cancellation conditions.</p><p>Payments may be processed through Razorpay or another payment provider designated by us.</p><p>By purchasing a subscription, you authorize the applicable payment transaction. Subscription access will generally be activated after successful payment confirmation.</p><p>Where recurring billing is offered, the applicable renewal frequency and cancellation process will be disclosed before purchase. Any automatic renewal will be subject to the terms presented at checkout and applicable law.</p><p>We may change subscription prices or features prospectively. Material changes affecting existing subscriptions will be communicated where required.</p><h2>Subscription Cancellation and Refunds</h2><p>Subscription cancellation and refunds will be governed by the specific plan terms displayed at the time of purchase and applicable law.</p><p>Unless a different policy is expressly displayed:</p><ul><li>Cancelling a subscription may prevent future renewals without automatically refunding the current billing period.</li><li>Refund requests will be assessed based on the applicable subscription terms, payment status, service delivery, and legal requirements.</li><li>Failed, duplicate, or unauthorized transactions may be investigated and handled through the applicable payment provider and our support process.</li><li>Cancellation of a subscription does not necessarily delete the user's account.</li></ul><p>Nothing in these terms limits consumer rights or refund entitlements that cannot legally be excluded.</p><h2>User Content and Intellectual Property</h2><p>Users retain ownership of content they lawfully own and upload to the Platform, including photographs, biographies, videos, and portfolio materials.</p><p>By uploading content, you grant FindMyMusicGurukul a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license to host, store, display, reproduce, and use that content as reasonably necessary to operate, maintain, and promote the Platform, subject to your settings, applicable law, and any additional consent requirements.</p><p>You must not upload content that:</p><ul><li>Infringes intellectual property or other legal rights.</li><li>Is unlawful, fraudulent, defamatory, abusive, or misleading.</li><li>Contains malicious software or compromises security.</li><li>Violates another person's privacy or consent.</li><li>Exploits or endangers minors.</li></ul><p>The FindMyMusicGurukul name, branding, original website design, software, and other platform materials may not be copied or commercially reused without authorization, except where permitted by law.</p><h2>Prohibited Activities</h2><p>Users must not:</p><ul><li>Impersonate another person or misrepresent qualifications.</li><li>Use the Platform for fraud, unlawful activity, or harassment.</li><li>Attempt unauthorized access to accounts, databases, or systems.</li><li>Copy, scrape, or commercially exploit platform data without permission.</li><li>Distribute malware, spam, or deceptive advertisements.</li><li>Circumvent subscription controls or payment mechanisms.</li><li>Collect or misuse another user's personal information.</li><li>Engage in inappropriate, exploitative, or unsafe conduct toward minors.</li></ul><p>We may investigate suspected violations and take proportionate action, including content removal, account restrictions, or suspension.</p><h2>Our Role as a Platform</h2><p>FindMyMusicGurukul facilitates the discovery of music tutors and connections between learners and educators. Unless expressly stated otherwise, we do not directly provide music instruction or employ the independent tutors listed on the Platform.</p><p>We do not guarantee a tutor's qualifications, availability, teaching quality, or learning outcomes. User-submitted profile information may not be independently verified unless we expressly state otherwise.</p><p>Users are responsible for evaluating tutors and agreeing on lesson arrangements. Nothing in this section excludes liability that cannot legally be excluded.</p><h2>Third-Party Services</h2><p>Our Platform may integrate third-party services, including Razorpay for payment processing and external email delivery providers for notifications.</p><p>Third-party services may have separate terms, privacy policies, and service conditions. Their processing of information is subject to applicable agreements and laws.</p><p>We are not responsible for third-party service interruptions or practices beyond our reasonable control, subject to applicable law.</p><h2>Suspension and Account Termination</h2><p>We may restrict or suspend an account where reasonably necessary to address violations of these terms, fraud, security threats, unlawful conduct, or risks to other users.</p><p>Users may stop using the Platform and request account deletion through the available account settings or by contacting us. Account closure does not remove records that we are legally required or otherwise lawfully entitled to retain.</p><h2>Disclaimer and Limitation of Liability</h2><p>The Platform is provided on an “as available” basis. We aim to maintain reliable services but do not guarantee uninterrupted, error-free availability.</p><p>To the extent permitted by applicable law, FindMyMusicGurukul will not be responsible for indirect or consequential losses arising from service interruptions, user-generated content, or independent arrangements between tutors and students.</p><p>Nothing in these terms excludes or restricts liability for fraud, wilful misconduct, or other liability that cannot lawfully be excluded.</p><h2>Changes to These Terms</h2><p>We may update these Terms & Conditions to reflect changes to the Platform, subscription services, business practices, or legal requirements.</p><p>Revised terms will be published on this page with an updated date. Where required, we will provide notice or obtain consent before implementing material changes.</p><h2>Governing Law and Disputes</h2><p>These Terms & Conditions are governed by the laws of India, subject to applicable mandatory legal protections.</p><p>Disputes will be addressed through appropriate dispute resolution procedures or competent courts having jurisdiction under applicable law.</p><h2>Contact Information</h2><p>For questions, complaints, or requests relating to these Terms & Conditions, please contact FindMyMusicGurukul through the contact details published on our website.</p><p><strong>Business name:</strong> FindMyMusicGurukul</p><p><strong>Support email:</strong> To be published before launch</p><p><strong>Business address:</strong> To be published where required</p><p>We will update this section when our official support contact details are available.</p>",
  "privacyPolicy": "<h1>Privacy&nbsp;Policy</h1><h2>Introduction</h2><p>FindMyMusicGurukul&nbsp;(“we,”&nbsp;“our,”&nbsp;or&nbsp;“us”)&nbsp;respects&nbsp;your&nbsp;privacy&nbsp;and&nbsp;is&nbsp;committed&nbsp;to&nbsp;handling&nbsp;personal&nbsp;information&nbsp;responsibly.</p><p>This&nbsp;Privacy&nbsp;Policy&nbsp;explains&nbsp;how&nbsp;we&nbsp;collect,&nbsp;use,&nbsp;store,&nbsp;disclose,&nbsp;and&nbsp;protect&nbsp;information&nbsp;when&nbsp;you&nbsp;visit&nbsp;our&nbsp;website,&nbsp;register&nbsp;an&nbsp;account,&nbsp;create&nbsp;a&nbsp;tutor&nbsp;profile,&nbsp;search&nbsp;for&nbsp;music&nbsp;lessons,&nbsp;purchase&nbsp;a&nbsp;subscription,&nbsp;or&nbsp;contact&nbsp;us.</p><p>This&nbsp;policy&nbsp;applies&nbsp;to&nbsp;students,&nbsp;tutors,&nbsp;visitors,&nbsp;and&nbsp;other&nbsp;users&nbsp;of&nbsp;our&nbsp;Platform.&nbsp;Our&nbsp;handling&nbsp;of&nbsp;personal&nbsp;information&nbsp;is&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;data&nbsp;protection&nbsp;and&nbsp;other&nbsp;laws.</p><h2>Information&nbsp;We&nbsp;Collect</h2><p>We&nbsp;collect&nbsp;information&nbsp;that&nbsp;you&nbsp;provide&nbsp;directly,&nbsp;information&nbsp;generated&nbsp;through&nbsp;your&nbsp;use&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Platform,&nbsp;and&nbsp;limited&nbsp;information&nbsp;received&nbsp;from&nbsp;service&nbsp;providers&nbsp;where&nbsp;necessary.</p><h3>Account&nbsp;and&nbsp;Contact&nbsp;Information</h3><p>Depending&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;features&nbsp;you&nbsp;use,&nbsp;this&nbsp;may&nbsp;include:</p><ul><li>Full&nbsp;name&nbsp;and&nbsp;username.</li><li>Email&nbsp;address&nbsp;and&nbsp;mobile&nbsp;number,&nbsp;where&nbsp;provided.</li><li>Account&nbsp;type,&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;student&nbsp;or&nbsp;tutor.</li><li>Authentication&nbsp;and&nbsp;account-management&nbsp;information.</li><li>Profile&nbsp;photograph&nbsp;and&nbsp;other&nbsp;information&nbsp;you&nbsp;choose&nbsp;to&nbsp;provide.</li></ul><p>Passwords&nbsp;should&nbsp;be&nbsp;stored&nbsp;using&nbsp;appropriate&nbsp;secure&nbsp;hashing&nbsp;methods&nbsp;rather&nbsp;than&nbsp;in&nbsp;plain&nbsp;text.</p><h3>Tutor&nbsp;Profile&nbsp;Information</h3><p>Tutors&nbsp;may&nbsp;provide:</p><ul><li>Music&nbsp;specializations&nbsp;and&nbsp;instruments&nbsp;taught.</li><li>Qualifications,&nbsp;certifications,&nbsp;and&nbsp;experience.</li><li>Teaching&nbsp;preferences&nbsp;and&nbsp;lesson&nbsp;formats.</li><li>Availability,&nbsp;location,&nbsp;and&nbsp;fees.</li><li>Photographs,&nbsp;introduction&nbsp;videos,&nbsp;and&nbsp;portfolio&nbsp;materials.</li></ul><p>Information&nbsp;displayed&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;public&nbsp;tutor&nbsp;profile&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;visible&nbsp;to&nbsp;website&nbsp;visitors.&nbsp;Tutors&nbsp;should&nbsp;not&nbsp;publish&nbsp;private&nbsp;or&nbsp;sensitive&nbsp;information&nbsp;in&nbsp;public&nbsp;profile&nbsp;fields.</p><h3>Student&nbsp;Information</h3><p>Where&nbsp;applicable,&nbsp;we&nbsp;may&nbsp;collect:</p><ul><li>Preferred&nbsp;music&nbsp;categories&nbsp;or&nbsp;instruments.</li><li>Learning&nbsp;goals&nbsp;and&nbsp;experience&nbsp;level.</li><li>Preferred&nbsp;location&nbsp;or&nbsp;lesson&nbsp;format.</li><li>Enquiries&nbsp;and&nbsp;communications&nbsp;with&nbsp;tutors.</li><li>Other&nbsp;information&nbsp;voluntarily&nbsp;submitted&nbsp;through&nbsp;the&nbsp;Platform.</li></ul><p>Where&nbsp;information&nbsp;relates&nbsp;to&nbsp;a&nbsp;minor,&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;handle&nbsp;it&nbsp;in&nbsp;accordance&nbsp;with&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;legal&nbsp;requirements,&nbsp;including&nbsp;parental&nbsp;or&nbsp;guardian&nbsp;consent&nbsp;where&nbsp;required.</p><h3>Subscription&nbsp;and&nbsp;Payment&nbsp;Information</h3><p>If&nbsp;you&nbsp;purchase&nbsp;a&nbsp;subscription,&nbsp;we&nbsp;may&nbsp;process:</p><ul><li>Selected&nbsp;subscription&nbsp;plan&nbsp;and&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;price.</li><li>Transaction&nbsp;reference&nbsp;and&nbsp;payment&nbsp;status.</li><li>Subscription&nbsp;activation,&nbsp;renewal,&nbsp;and&nbsp;cancellation&nbsp;records.</li><li>Billing&nbsp;details&nbsp;and&nbsp;invoices,&nbsp;where&nbsp;applicable.</li><li>Refund&nbsp;requests&nbsp;and&nbsp;payment-related&nbsp;correspondence.</li></ul><p>Payments&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;processed&nbsp;by&nbsp;Razorpay&nbsp;or&nbsp;another&nbsp;designated&nbsp;payment&nbsp;service&nbsp;provider.</p><p>Payment&nbsp;card&nbsp;information,&nbsp;CVV&nbsp;codes,&nbsp;banking&nbsp;passwords,&nbsp;and&nbsp;similar&nbsp;payment&nbsp;credentials&nbsp;should&nbsp;be&nbsp;handled&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;payment&nbsp;provider&nbsp;rather&nbsp;than&nbsp;stored&nbsp;on&nbsp;our&nbsp;servers.&nbsp;We&nbsp;may&nbsp;receive&nbsp;transaction&nbsp;identifiers&nbsp;and&nbsp;confirmation&nbsp;details&nbsp;needed&nbsp;to&nbsp;manage&nbsp;subscriptions&nbsp;and&nbsp;respond&nbsp;to&nbsp;payment&nbsp;issues.</p><h3>Technical&nbsp;and&nbsp;Usage&nbsp;Information</h3><p>When&nbsp;you&nbsp;use&nbsp;the&nbsp;Platform,&nbsp;we&nbsp;may&nbsp;collect&nbsp;limited&nbsp;technical&nbsp;information,&nbsp;depending&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;features&nbsp;and&nbsp;tools&nbsp;enabled:</p><ul><li>IP&nbsp;address&nbsp;and&nbsp;browser&nbsp;type.</li><li>Device&nbsp;and&nbsp;operating&nbsp;system&nbsp;information.</li><li>Pages&nbsp;visited&nbsp;and&nbsp;interactions&nbsp;with&nbsp;platform&nbsp;features.</li><li>Login&nbsp;activity,&nbsp;timestamps,&nbsp;and&nbsp;session&nbsp;information.</li><li>Error&nbsp;reports,&nbsp;security&nbsp;logs,&nbsp;and&nbsp;performance&nbsp;information.</li><li>Cookies&nbsp;or&nbsp;similar&nbsp;identifiers,&nbsp;where&nbsp;enabled.</li></ul><h2>How&nbsp;We&nbsp;Use&nbsp;Your&nbsp;Information</h2><p>We&nbsp;use&nbsp;personal&nbsp;information&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;following&nbsp;purposes:</p><ul><li>Creating&nbsp;and&nbsp;maintaining&nbsp;accounts.</li><li>Displaying&nbsp;tutor&nbsp;profiles&nbsp;and&nbsp;enabling&nbsp;tutor&nbsp;discovery.</li><li>Connecting&nbsp;learners&nbsp;and&nbsp;tutors.</li><li>Managing&nbsp;subscriptions,&nbsp;billing&nbsp;records,&nbsp;and&nbsp;payment&nbsp;confirmations.</li><li>Sending&nbsp;account-related&nbsp;emails&nbsp;and&nbsp;transaction&nbsp;notifications.</li><li>Responding&nbsp;to&nbsp;enquiries&nbsp;and&nbsp;providing&nbsp;customer&nbsp;support.</li><li>Maintaining&nbsp;website&nbsp;security&nbsp;and&nbsp;preventing&nbsp;fraud&nbsp;or&nbsp;abuse.</li><li>Improving&nbsp;platform&nbsp;functionality&nbsp;and&nbsp;reliability.</li><li>Resolving&nbsp;disputes&nbsp;and&nbsp;enforcing&nbsp;our&nbsp;Terms&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Conditions.</li><li>Meeting&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;legal&nbsp;and&nbsp;regulatory&nbsp;obligations.</li></ul><p>We&nbsp;will&nbsp;process&nbsp;personal&nbsp;information&nbsp;for&nbsp;disclosed&nbsp;and&nbsp;legitimate&nbsp;purposes&nbsp;and&nbsp;obtain&nbsp;consent&nbsp;or&nbsp;rely&nbsp;on&nbsp;another&nbsp;lawful&nbsp;basis&nbsp;where&nbsp;required&nbsp;by&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;law.</p><h2>Public&nbsp;Profiles&nbsp;and&nbsp;Information&nbsp;Shared&nbsp;with&nbsp;Other&nbsp;Users</h2><p>Certain&nbsp;information&nbsp;that&nbsp;tutors&nbsp;voluntarily&nbsp;submit&nbsp;to&nbsp;public&nbsp;profiles,&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;their&nbsp;name,&nbsp;qualifications,&nbsp;music&nbsp;specializations,&nbsp;experience,&nbsp;and&nbsp;portfolio&nbsp;materials,&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;visible&nbsp;to&nbsp;visitors.</p><p>Information&nbsp;submitted&nbsp;through&nbsp;an&nbsp;enquiry&nbsp;or&nbsp;contact&nbsp;feature&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;shared&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;tutor&nbsp;or&nbsp;student&nbsp;to&nbsp;facilitate&nbsp;communication.</p><p>We&nbsp;encourage&nbsp;users&nbsp;to&nbsp;share&nbsp;only&nbsp;information&nbsp;necessary&nbsp;for&nbsp;their&nbsp;intended&nbsp;purpose.&nbsp;Do&nbsp;not&nbsp;publish&nbsp;private&nbsp;contact&nbsp;details,&nbsp;financial&nbsp;information,&nbsp;identity&nbsp;documents,&nbsp;or&nbsp;other&nbsp;sensitive&nbsp;information&nbsp;in&nbsp;public&nbsp;profile&nbsp;fields.</p><h2>Sharing&nbsp;Information&nbsp;with&nbsp;Service&nbsp;Providers</h2><p>We&nbsp;may&nbsp;share&nbsp;information&nbsp;with&nbsp;trusted&nbsp;service&nbsp;providers&nbsp;when&nbsp;necessary&nbsp;to&nbsp;operate&nbsp;the&nbsp;Platform.</p><h3>Payment&nbsp;Processing</h3><p>We&nbsp;may&nbsp;share&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;transaction&nbsp;and&nbsp;subscription&nbsp;information&nbsp;with&nbsp;Razorpay&nbsp;or&nbsp;another&nbsp;designated&nbsp;payment&nbsp;provider&nbsp;to&nbsp;process&nbsp;payments,&nbsp;confirm&nbsp;transactions,&nbsp;manage&nbsp;refunds,&nbsp;and&nbsp;prevent&nbsp;payment&nbsp;fraud.</p><p>Payment&nbsp;processing&nbsp;is&nbsp;also&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;payment&nbsp;provider&#39;s&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;terms&nbsp;and&nbsp;privacy&nbsp;policy.</p><h3>Email&nbsp;Notifications</h3><p>We&nbsp;may&nbsp;use&nbsp;third-party&nbsp;email&nbsp;delivery&nbsp;providers&nbsp;to&nbsp;send&nbsp;account&nbsp;verification&nbsp;messages,&nbsp;subscription&nbsp;confirmations,&nbsp;service&nbsp;updates,&nbsp;security&nbsp;alerts,&nbsp;and&nbsp;support&nbsp;responses.</p><p>These&nbsp;providers&nbsp;may&nbsp;process&nbsp;email&nbsp;addresses,&nbsp;message&nbsp;content,&nbsp;delivery&nbsp;status,&nbsp;and&nbsp;related&nbsp;technical&nbsp;information&nbsp;as&nbsp;necessary&nbsp;to&nbsp;deliver&nbsp;communications.</p><h3>Hosting&nbsp;and&nbsp;Technical&nbsp;Operations</h3><p>If&nbsp;we&nbsp;use&nbsp;hosting&nbsp;providers,&nbsp;databases,&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;infrastructure,&nbsp;or&nbsp;technical&nbsp;support&nbsp;services,&nbsp;necessary&nbsp;information&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;processed&nbsp;by&nbsp;those&nbsp;providers&nbsp;to&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;and&nbsp;secure&nbsp;the&nbsp;Platform.</p><p>We&nbsp;expect&nbsp;our&nbsp;service&nbsp;providers&nbsp;to&nbsp;protect&nbsp;information&nbsp;appropriately&nbsp;and&nbsp;process&nbsp;it&nbsp;according&nbsp;to&nbsp;their&nbsp;responsibilities&nbsp;and&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;law.</p><h2>Legal&nbsp;Disclosures&nbsp;and&nbsp;Business&nbsp;Transfers</h2><p>We&nbsp;may&nbsp;disclose&nbsp;information&nbsp;when&nbsp;reasonably&nbsp;necessary&nbsp;to&nbsp;comply&nbsp;with&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;law,&nbsp;respond&nbsp;to&nbsp;lawful&nbsp;requests,&nbsp;investigate&nbsp;suspected&nbsp;fraud,&nbsp;protect&nbsp;users,&nbsp;or&nbsp;safeguard&nbsp;our&nbsp;legal&nbsp;rights.</p><p>If&nbsp;FindMyMusicGurukul&nbsp;undergoes&nbsp;a&nbsp;merger,&nbsp;acquisition,&nbsp;restructuring,&nbsp;or&nbsp;business&nbsp;transfer,&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;information&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;transferred&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;appropriate&nbsp;safeguards&nbsp;and&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;legal&nbsp;requirements.</p><p>We&nbsp;do&nbsp;not&nbsp;intend&nbsp;to&nbsp;sell&nbsp;personal&nbsp;information&nbsp;to&nbsp;third&nbsp;parties&nbsp;for&nbsp;their&nbsp;independent&nbsp;marketing&nbsp;purposes.</p><h2>Cookies&nbsp;and&nbsp;Similar&nbsp;Technologies</h2><p>Our&nbsp;website&nbsp;may&nbsp;use&nbsp;cookies,&nbsp;session&nbsp;identifiers,&nbsp;and&nbsp;similar&nbsp;technologies&nbsp;to:</p><ul><li>Maintain&nbsp;login&nbsp;sessions.</li><li>Remember&nbsp;preferences.</li><li>Support&nbsp;website&nbsp;security.</li><li>Improve&nbsp;functionality&nbsp;and&nbsp;performance.</li><li>Understand&nbsp;website&nbsp;usage&nbsp;where&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;tools&nbsp;are&nbsp;enabled.</li></ul><p>You&nbsp;may&nbsp;manage&nbsp;cookies&nbsp;through&nbsp;your&nbsp;browser&nbsp;settings.&nbsp;Disabling&nbsp;certain&nbsp;cookies&nbsp;may&nbsp;affect&nbsp;login&nbsp;sessions&nbsp;or&nbsp;other&nbsp;features.</p><p>Where&nbsp;required,&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;provide&nbsp;appropriate&nbsp;notices&nbsp;and&nbsp;consent&nbsp;controls&nbsp;before&nbsp;using&nbsp;non-essential&nbsp;cookies&nbsp;or&nbsp;similar&nbsp;technologies.</p><h2>Data&nbsp;Security</h2><p>We&nbsp;take&nbsp;reasonable&nbsp;technical&nbsp;and&nbsp;organizational&nbsp;measures&nbsp;designed&nbsp;to&nbsp;protect&nbsp;personal&nbsp;information&nbsp;from&nbsp;unauthorized&nbsp;access,&nbsp;disclosure,&nbsp;alteration,&nbsp;loss,&nbsp;and&nbsp;misuse.</p><p>Depending&nbsp;on&nbsp;our&nbsp;implementation,&nbsp;safeguards&nbsp;may&nbsp;include&nbsp;secure&nbsp;connections,&nbsp;access&nbsp;restrictions,&nbsp;password&nbsp;hashing,&nbsp;limited&nbsp;administrative&nbsp;permissions,&nbsp;backups,&nbsp;and&nbsp;security&nbsp;monitoring.</p><p>No&nbsp;internet&nbsp;transmission&nbsp;or&nbsp;electronic&nbsp;storage&nbsp;method&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;guaranteed&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;completely&nbsp;secure.&nbsp;We&nbsp;will&nbsp;handle&nbsp;personal&nbsp;data&nbsp;breaches&nbsp;and&nbsp;related&nbsp;notifications&nbsp;in&nbsp;accordance&nbsp;with&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;legal&nbsp;requirements.</p><h2>Data&nbsp;Retention&nbsp;and&nbsp;Deletion</h2><p>We&nbsp;retain&nbsp;personal&nbsp;information&nbsp;only&nbsp;for&nbsp;as&nbsp;long&nbsp;as&nbsp;reasonably&nbsp;necessary&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;purposes&nbsp;described&nbsp;in&nbsp;this&nbsp;policy,&nbsp;including&nbsp;account&nbsp;management,&nbsp;subscription&nbsp;administration,&nbsp;dispute&nbsp;resolution,&nbsp;security,&nbsp;and&nbsp;legal&nbsp;compliance.</p><p>When&nbsp;information&nbsp;is&nbsp;no&nbsp;longer&nbsp;required,&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;delete&nbsp;it&nbsp;or&nbsp;anonymize&nbsp;it,&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;retention&nbsp;obligations&nbsp;and&nbsp;other&nbsp;lawful&nbsp;grounds&nbsp;for&nbsp;retention.</p><p>Some&nbsp;financial,&nbsp;transaction,&nbsp;accounting,&nbsp;security,&nbsp;or&nbsp;dispute-related&nbsp;records&nbsp;may&nbsp;need&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;retained&nbsp;after&nbsp;account&nbsp;closure.</p><p>Where&nbsp;deletion&nbsp;is&nbsp;requested,&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;assess&nbsp;the&nbsp;request&nbsp;in&nbsp;accordance&nbsp;with&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;law&nbsp;and&nbsp;explain&nbsp;any&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;limitations&nbsp;where&nbsp;appropriate.</p><h2>Your&nbsp;Privacy&nbsp;Rights&nbsp;and&nbsp;Choices</h2><p>Subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;law,&nbsp;you&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;entitled&nbsp;to:</p><ul><li>Request&nbsp;information&nbsp;about&nbsp;personal&nbsp;data&nbsp;associated&nbsp;with&nbsp;your&nbsp;account.</li><li>Request&nbsp;correction&nbsp;or&nbsp;updating&nbsp;of&nbsp;inaccurate&nbsp;information.</li><li>Request&nbsp;deletion&nbsp;of&nbsp;personal&nbsp;information&nbsp;where&nbsp;applicable.</li><li>Withdraw&nbsp;consent&nbsp;where&nbsp;processing&nbsp;relies&nbsp;on&nbsp;consent.</li><li>Manage&nbsp;optional&nbsp;communications&nbsp;and&nbsp;preferences.</li><li>Raise&nbsp;a&nbsp;privacy&nbsp;complaint.</li><li>Exercise&nbsp;other&nbsp;rights&nbsp;available&nbsp;under&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;data&nbsp;protection&nbsp;laws.</li></ul><p>You&nbsp;may&nbsp;submit&nbsp;requests&nbsp;through&nbsp;the&nbsp;contact&nbsp;details&nbsp;published&nbsp;on&nbsp;our&nbsp;website.&nbsp;We&nbsp;may&nbsp;request&nbsp;reasonable&nbsp;information&nbsp;to&nbsp;verify&nbsp;your&nbsp;identity&nbsp;before&nbsp;processing&nbsp;a&nbsp;request.</p><p>Withdrawal&nbsp;of&nbsp;consent&nbsp;does&nbsp;not&nbsp;affect&nbsp;processing&nbsp;that&nbsp;occurred&nbsp;lawfully&nbsp;before&nbsp;withdrawal.&nbsp;It&nbsp;may&nbsp;also&nbsp;affect&nbsp;features&nbsp;that&nbsp;depend&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;information.</p><h2>Children&#39;s&nbsp;Privacy&nbsp;and&nbsp;Parental&nbsp;Involvement</h2><p>Music&nbsp;learners&nbsp;may&nbsp;include&nbsp;minors.&nbsp;Where&nbsp;minors&nbsp;use&nbsp;FindMyMusicGurukul,&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;apply&nbsp;appropriate&nbsp;safeguards&nbsp;and&nbsp;follow&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;concerning&nbsp;age,&nbsp;parental&nbsp;or&nbsp;guardian&nbsp;consent,&nbsp;and&nbsp;children&#39;s&nbsp;personal&nbsp;information.</p><p>Where&nbsp;required&nbsp;by&nbsp;law,&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;obtain&nbsp;verifiable&nbsp;parental&nbsp;or&nbsp;lawful&nbsp;guardian&nbsp;consent&nbsp;before&nbsp;processing&nbsp;a&nbsp;child&#39;s&nbsp;personal&nbsp;data.</p><p>Parents&nbsp;or&nbsp;legal&nbsp;guardians&nbsp;may&nbsp;contact&nbsp;us&nbsp;with&nbsp;questions&nbsp;or&nbsp;requests&nbsp;concerning&nbsp;a&nbsp;child&#39;s&nbsp;information,&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;identity&nbsp;verification&nbsp;and&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;legal&nbsp;requirements.</p><p>We&nbsp;do&nbsp;not&nbsp;intend&nbsp;to&nbsp;knowingly&nbsp;process&nbsp;children&#39;s&nbsp;personal&nbsp;information&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;manner&nbsp;prohibited&nbsp;by&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;law.</p><h2>Third-Party&nbsp;Services&nbsp;and&nbsp;Links</h2><p>Our&nbsp;Platform&nbsp;may&nbsp;contain&nbsp;links&nbsp;to&nbsp;third-party&nbsp;websites&nbsp;or&nbsp;integrate&nbsp;external&nbsp;services,&nbsp;including&nbsp;payment&nbsp;processing&nbsp;and&nbsp;email&nbsp;delivery.</p><p>Those&nbsp;third&nbsp;parties&nbsp;may&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;separate&nbsp;privacy&nbsp;policies&nbsp;and&nbsp;practices.&nbsp;We&nbsp;encourage&nbsp;users&nbsp;to&nbsp;review&nbsp;their&nbsp;policies&nbsp;before&nbsp;interacting&nbsp;with&nbsp;external&nbsp;services.</p><p>Our&nbsp;Privacy&nbsp;Policy&nbsp;does&nbsp;not&nbsp;govern&nbsp;information&nbsp;that&nbsp;a&nbsp;third&nbsp;party&nbsp;independently&nbsp;collects&nbsp;and&nbsp;processes&nbsp;under&nbsp;its&nbsp;own&nbsp;policies.</p><h2>International&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Processing</h2><p>Our&nbsp;service&nbsp;providers&nbsp;may&nbsp;process&nbsp;information&nbsp;using&nbsp;infrastructure&nbsp;located&nbsp;in&nbsp;India&nbsp;or&nbsp;other&nbsp;countries,&nbsp;depending&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;services&nbsp;enabled.</p><p>Where&nbsp;personal&nbsp;information&nbsp;is&nbsp;transferred&nbsp;or&nbsp;processed&nbsp;across&nbsp;borders,&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;address&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;legal&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;and&nbsp;any&nbsp;required&nbsp;safeguards.</p><h2>Marketing&nbsp;and&nbsp;Service&nbsp;Communications</h2><p>We&nbsp;may&nbsp;send&nbsp;essential&nbsp;communications&nbsp;concerning&nbsp;account&nbsp;activity,&nbsp;payment&nbsp;status,&nbsp;subscription&nbsp;renewals,&nbsp;security,&nbsp;and&nbsp;service&nbsp;changes.</p><p>Where&nbsp;promotional&nbsp;emails&nbsp;are&nbsp;offered,&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;obtain&nbsp;consent&nbsp;where&nbsp;required&nbsp;and&nbsp;provide&nbsp;an&nbsp;appropriate&nbsp;method&nbsp;to&nbsp;opt&nbsp;out.</p><p>Opting&nbsp;out&nbsp;of&nbsp;promotional&nbsp;communications&nbsp;will&nbsp;not&nbsp;necessarily&nbsp;stop&nbsp;essential&nbsp;service-related&nbsp;messages.</p><h2>Changes&nbsp;to&nbsp;This&nbsp;Privacy&nbsp;Policy</h2><p>We&nbsp;may&nbsp;update&nbsp;this&nbsp;Privacy&nbsp;Policy&nbsp;to&nbsp;reflect&nbsp;changes&nbsp;in&nbsp;our&nbsp;services,&nbsp;data-handling&nbsp;practices,&nbsp;third-party&nbsp;integrations,&nbsp;or&nbsp;legal&nbsp;obligations.</p><p>The&nbsp;updated&nbsp;policy&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;published&nbsp;on&nbsp;this&nbsp;page&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;revised&nbsp;date.&nbsp;Where&nbsp;required,&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;provide&nbsp;additional&nbsp;notice&nbsp;or&nbsp;obtain&nbsp;consent&nbsp;before&nbsp;implementing&nbsp;changes.</p><h2>Contact&nbsp;and&nbsp;Privacy&nbsp;Complaints</h2><p>For&nbsp;privacy&nbsp;questions,&nbsp;requests&nbsp;to&nbsp;access&nbsp;or&nbsp;correct&nbsp;information,&nbsp;deletion&nbsp;requests,&nbsp;consent&nbsp;withdrawal,&nbsp;or&nbsp;complaints,&nbsp;please&nbsp;contact&nbsp;FindMyMusicGurukul&nbsp;through&nbsp;the&nbsp;official&nbsp;contact&nbsp;details&nbsp;published&nbsp;on&nbsp;our&nbsp;website.</p><p><strong>Business&nbsp;name:</strong>&nbsp;FindMyMusicGurukul</p><p><strong>Privacy&nbsp;contact&nbsp;email:</strong>&nbsp;To&nbsp;be&nbsp;published&nbsp;before&nbsp;launch</p><p><strong>Business&nbsp;address:</strong>&nbsp;To&nbsp;be&nbsp;published&nbsp;where&nbsp;required</p><p>We&nbsp;will&nbsp;review&nbsp;privacy&nbsp;requests&nbsp;and&nbsp;complaints&nbsp;and&nbsp;respond&nbsp;in&nbsp;accordance&nbsp;with&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;legal&nbsp;requirements.</p>"
